## Step 1: Invoice submission

The vendor submits:

- Invoice PDF or JSON.
- Invoice number.
- Vendor ID.
- Amount.
- Currency.
- Requested token.
- Destination chain.
- Destination wallet.
- Invoice description.
- Purchase order reference.
